      "title" : "The day you threw a late-night pop reunion for every radio hit",
      "description" : "Evening kicked off with “Pump It” and never looked back—Calvin Harris, Lady Gaga, and Rihanna tag-teamed through a parade of 2010s pop and dance anthems. Every track was a callback: “Replay,” “Hey, Soul Sister,” and “Me And My Broken Heart” all made cameos. 86 minutes, 25 tracks, 25 artists—your most nostalgic night of the year.",
